[C1] PASS a column split into 2, 4 or 8 blocks with relayed anchors gives the one-block face pressures; the relay continues the same additions in the same order: max |difference| 0.0e+00 Pa
[C2] PASS at each seam the top face of the block below equals the bottom face of the block above: max |difference| at 3 seams 0.0e+00 Pa
